- deploy.sh: quote the protect filters for the remote shell
- deploy.sh: staging/live deploys from committed code (lint, dry run, confirm, server-side backup, tag, purge); repo-only files export-ignored
- Live theme as of 2026-11-11 (rsg_2022 from live; backups/logs excluded; files with hard-coded keys kept out, see SECRETS.md)$q$, 'live-20261111-080859', 'deploy.sh');
